---
// Lifted verbatim from the single-page build (Phase 2). Had zero motion —
// the last thing on every one of the 44 routes was a flat, static block.
// `.m-rise` on the footer itself; `.m-stagger` on the four-column row so
// they cascade rather than arrive as one flat pop, using motion.css's
// --n-indexed animation-range, no JS timer.
---
<footer class="m-rise">
