          They render differently on every platform, sit on the text baseline
          rather than optically centred, and read as a personal message rather
          than an institution's contact block. Inline SVG instead: one stroke
          weight, one size, aligned, and inheriting the link colour.
          The IDs are load-bearing — boot.js and admin.js write the phone
          number and the WhatsApp hrefs into them. */}
